  "description": "This is a library designed to simplify interactions with Azure Storage, Azure FileShare, and local directory structures. It provides an easy-to-use API for uploading and downloading entire directory structures with minimal commands. Features include multiple authentication modes (ConnectionString, ManagedIdentity, UserToken), chunked uploads for large files, container synchronization, and comprehensive async support with cancellation tokens.",
  "id": "DevelopmentHelpers.Storage.Core",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-07T02:08:22.09Z",
